Description: Computes Framingham Pace of Aging Calculated from the Epigenome (FraminghamPACE) scores from DNA methylation beta-value matrices. Supports Illumina 450K, EPIC, EPIC v2, and MSA arrays and provides Elastic Net and Ridge model variants.
